== Walkthrough ==

''[[Tyokan Mekase]] can be found in a building near the Temple of Life pool during daytime hours. He shares a spawn point with [[Whysia Flock]] who appears during the night.''

'''Hand Tyokan your used [[Prayer Beads]].'''

: Tyokan Mekase says, 'As instructed by High Priestess Jahnda I must ask for the beads and a donation of 100 gold coins.'

'''Hand him 100 gold coins (gold only, multi-questable).'''

: Tyokan Mekase says, 'I see your beads need to be charged. Very well, here you are. Use them and good health to you!!!'

You receive a fully charged set of [[Prayer Beads]].

